msgctxt "76"
msgid "Uncle Kaz... We don't have to leave, do we?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Not if I can help it. I'm not about to let those guys kick\r\n"
"us out of our home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"They must be Ryudo Family boys. That's who's been sending us\r\n"
"those letters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"One way or another, it's gonna have to stop. I can't have\r\n"
"them keep scaring you guys."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Maybe I should pay this Ryudo Family a little visit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Don't worry, Haruka. I'm not planning on getting into any\r\n"
"fights, even if they are yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Just... be careful, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I will. Be back tonight."
msgstr ""

